                                "sense_id": "27797dd6-374a-32ed-a0db-57c9d1cc9c4f",
                                "text": "With any summe you are afraid to lose / But in the night, but then take heed of those / Base Padding Rascalls, for their kill-calfe law / I am not priuy to, I neuer saw / Them, nor their actions, then I cannot show / How to preuent the thing I doe not know."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e8ba21c-7c22-4ceb-ba69-27b3b4571f6b",
                                "sense_id": "27797dd6-374a-32ed-a0db-57c9d1cc9c4f",
                                "text": "Sir Francis Drake's ship at Deptford, my Lord Mayor's barge, and divers secret and unsuspected places, and there they make private shambles with kill-calf cruelty, and sheep slaughtering murder, to the abuse of Lent, the deceiving of the informers, and the great grief of every zealous fishmonger."
                            }
